Welcome to Phoenix!

Logs are available here:
  Setup:     /mnt/recording-disk/phoenix-pvr/settings/firstboot.log
  Frontend:  /data/native-frontend/html-frontend.log
  Browser:   /data/native-frontend/chromium.log
  Tuners:    /data/nexus-tuner-manager/service.log
  TVHeadend: /mnt/recording-disk/phoenix-pvr/diagnostics/tvh/service.log
  HDMI:      /var/log/nexus-display.log
  Storage:   /var/log/alpine-data.log
  Network:   /var/log/udhcpc.log

To cleanly shut down the box, use:
  cd /root && /usr/local/sbin/data-stop && sync && /sbin/poweroff -f

To access the web portal, open your browser to:
  http://<device-ip>:9981

